course: dictionary
lesson: 12575
title: Getting smaller over time
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Diminishing means getting smaller, fewer or weaker over time. It describes something that shrinks a little at a time, not all at once. The word comes from diminish, so diminishes and diminished share the same idea.
explain: Look for clues that show change over time. «The water in the pond is diminishing as the summer goes on.» Words like as and on tell you the change is happening slowly, so the water is getting lower bit by bit.
explain: Try the swap check. In «diminishing light», you can put getting weaker in place of diminishing and the sentence still makes sense. So diminishing means getting less.
fact: Diminishing means getting smaller, fewer or weaker over time.
fact: «Diminishing supplies» means supplies that are running low, getting less and less.
fact: Scientists use this word for shrinking things, such as forests and ice.
fact: In maths, a diminishing number is going down.
fact: «Diminishing returns» means each extra effort gives a smaller reward than the one before.
exercise: «The ice on the lake is diminishing as spring gets warmer.» What is diminishing? | Getting colder | Getting wetter | Getting louder | *Getting smaller over time
exercise: «Our water supplies are diminishing, so we must save water.» What does diminishing mean? | Growing bigger every day | Staying exactly the same | *Running out, getting less and less | Being shared with everyone
exercise: «A diminishing number of birds came to the feeder.» Find and copy the word that means getting smaller. | birds | a | *diminishing | number
test: «The number of visitors is diminishing each year.» What does diminishing mean here? | Getting bigger | *Getting smaller over time | Staying the same | Arriving early
test: In maths, Sam says «the number is diminishing». What does she mean? | The number is breaking into pieces | *The number is going down | The number is staying the same | The number is going up
exam: «The diminishing light made it hard to read.» What does diminishing light mean? | Light that comes from a lamp | Light that is blue | *Light that is getting weaker over time | Light that is getting brighter
